## Complexity

Let `M` be the number of events.

Usually:

```text
Create events: O(M)
Sort events: O(M log M)
Sweep: O(M)

Total: O(M log M)
```

where:

```text
M = 2 × number_of_intervals
```

---

## One-Line Intuition

Convert intervals into events, sort them, and process them from left to right.

Remember:

```text
Difference Array = Mark boundaries in an array.

Line Sweep = Mark boundaries in sorted event space.
```